Audeze LCD-2 Headphones
&amp;#8232;Crown SASS-P MK II Stereo PZM Microphone
&amp;#8232;Format: 48kHz / 16-bit (Recorder maximum)

This is the recording of a purring female cat.
The recording had been done by placing the mic quite close to the cat throat and chest. 
Some noises and swishes are due to cat movements.

Recorder: Zoom H4;
Microphone: Zoom H4 built-in condenser microphone in an X-Y stereo pattern;
Processing: gain raising, slight denoising.

